From: John <john@primaryautotrd.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 15:02:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] build-compat: fix Kotlin/Soong compile under LOS-23.2 /
 Android-16

Targeted, no-functional-change fixes so the tree compiles: hoist a const out of a
non-const scope (DeskSwitchAnimationUtils), resolve Kotlin smart-cast-on-var errors
(PreferenceGraphBuilder), add -Xjvm-default=all-compatibility (SliderPreference), and
minor compat tweaks (SettingsTopAppBar, AppListRepository, AppIdAppFunctionAccessPolicy).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I5898c6840bf269f1c53a4a2c9ffecd5b89e01ae3
